Pin Rspack to 2.0.4 to avoid a crash in the win32-arm64 native binding.

The @rspack/binding-win32-arm64-msvc binary shipped with Rspack 2.0.1-2.0.3
segfaults (0xC0000005 / STATUS_ACCESS_VIOLATION) during Node process teardown.
As a result `jupyter lab build` returns a non-zero exit code and JupyterLab
reports "JupyterLab failed to build" even though the Rspack compilation itself
succeeds and all assets are produced. Rspack 2.0.4 bundles a fixed mimalloc
(>= 3.3.2) and exits cleanly.

Upstream issue: https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspack/issues/13925
